{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-022",
    "title": "：借火修行"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_114",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“因为火会让它找到你。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "归墟灵城崩塌后的第三天，三方来使同时抵达旧驿道。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3649,
          "end": 3649
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临和顾长离暂住在一座废弃的石亭里。两枚残印被包在不同的布袋中，分别放在石亭两端。只要其中一枚靠近另一枚，掌心青痕便会发冷，仿佛提醒他不要让两扇门在同一处打开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3651,
          "end": 3651
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜坐在亭外修补地图。灵城崩塌后，他肩上多了一道剑伤，却不肯使用疗伤符。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3653,
          "end": 3653
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们归墟盟为什么没有派人追来？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3655,
          "end": 3655
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“派了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3657,
          "end": 3657
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我没看见。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3659,
          "end": 3659
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为他们在等谁先找到我们。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3661,
          "end": 3661
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "话音刚落，旧驿道东侧传来剑鸣。三名玄霄宗修士踏着石路而来，为首者穿灰袍，腰间悬着一块白玉令牌。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3663,
          "end": 3663
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“奉玄霄宗长老令，带陆照临回山。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3665,
          "end": 3665
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜站起：“他不是你们的囚犯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3667,
          "end": 3667
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士看他：“归墟盟私闯宗门、诱拐弟子，已列入追责名单。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3669,
          "end": 3669
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们先把自己的失踪记录解释清楚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3671,
          "end": 3671
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士没有接话，转向陆照临：“你父亲陆沉舟曾受宗门雇佣。如今你持有宗门遗失之物，玄霄宗愿以护山令保你安全。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3673,
          "end": 3673
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“条件？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3675,
          "end": 3675
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在旁边笑了：“说得好听。你们想要的是他记忆里的太虚坐标。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3701,
          "end": 3701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向他：“归墟盟想要的也不只是坐标。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3703,
          "end": 3703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“至少我们承认想要改写权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3705,
          "end": 3705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方在旧驿道中央对峙。陆照临握住两只布袋，感到残印的寒意沿手臂上升。他想起灵城石厅里的三条未来：点灯、毁印、带离。每一条都没有安全的结局。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3707,
          "end": 3707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗能告诉我陆沉舟现在在哪里吗？”他问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3709,
          "end": 3709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士答：“灵城崩塌后，所有人都在寻找他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3711,
          "end": 3711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括你们？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3713,
          "end": 3713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3715,
          "end": 3715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你们为什么说他是失踪的引灯人，不是被太虚遗脉承载的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3717,
          "end": 3717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3719,
          "end": 3719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把修补好的地图递给陆照临：“跟我走，去归墟盟总坛。那里有三百年前的原始盟约。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3721,
          "end": 3721
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻说：“跟我走，去无相寺。那里有完整的旧灾证词。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3723,
          "end": 3723
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士最后开口：“跟我回玄霄宗。只有宗门知道天门何时会再次开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3725,
          "end": 3725
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三份条件摆在陆照临面前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3727,
          "end": 3727
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟提供路线，无相寺提供记忆，玄霄宗提供时间。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3729,
          "end": 3729
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到他身边：“你可以谁都不选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3731,
          "end": 3731
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我们去哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3733,
          "end": 3733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“去找第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3735,
          "end": 3735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她从袖中取出一张新抄的账页。账页上写着：第三盏灯未入灵城，最后一次记录在北境雪原。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3737,
          "end": 3737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向灰袍修士：“玄霄宗知道雪原上的灯吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3739,
          "end": 3739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士的眼神终于出现裂缝：“那是封锁区域。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3741,
          "end": 3741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3743,
          "end": 3743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为天门的影子在那里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3745,
          "end": 3745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜收起地图：“所以你们也不知道陆沉舟是否在那里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3747,
          "end": 3747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“没有人知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3749,
          "end": 3749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻转动木珠：“知道与记得，正在变成两件事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3751,
          "end": 3751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处雪线忽然亮起一道青光。旧驿道的路碑一个接一个裂开，石缝中渗出灰白粉末。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3753,
          "end": 3753
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临掌心的两枚残印同时震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3755,
          "end": 3755
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士后退一步：“第三盏灯醒了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3757,
          "end": 3757
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们不是说它在雪原？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3759,
          "end": 3759
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它正在从雪原回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3761,
          "end": 3761
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光沿旧驿道向他们逼近，所过之处，草木瞬间结霜。叶观澜拔刀，慧闻闭目念了一句经文，玄霄宗三名弟子则结成防御阵。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3763,
          "end": 3763
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“闭眼，听灯声。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3867,
          "end": 3867
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临照做。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3869,
          "end": 3869
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "起初，他只听见风。风穿过岩洞，撞在石壁上，像无数人在低声说话。渐渐地，风声中出现了灯罩碰撞的节奏，一声、两声、三声，随后停下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3871,
          "end": 3871
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三声之后，灵气从地面涌入他的脚底。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3873,
          "end": 3873
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那不是温暖的灵气，而是一股带着冰霜的寒流。寒流沿经脉向上，经过膝、腹、胸口，最后在眉心汇成一点青光。陆照临本能地想把它压回气海，叶观澜却按住他的肩。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3875,
          "end": 3875
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别收。让它经过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3877,
          "end": 3877
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会伤到经脉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3879,
          "end": 3879
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你若只守气海，永远打不开第二道门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3881,
          "end": 3881
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临咬牙承受。青光经过胸口时，眼前忽然浮出雪地影像。年幼的自己站在老槐树下，陆沉舟把一盏空灯放到他手里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3883,
          "end": 3883
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记住第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3885,
          "end": 3885
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它为什么没有火？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3887,
          "end": 3887
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为火会让它找到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3889,
          "end": 3889
        }
      }
    ],
